-- New stories: 3 Canada stories covering the 2022 federal B2G
-- mandate via SAP Ariba (the only hard requirement), DBNAlliance's
-- growing 2026 momentum as the voluntary North American option, and
-- the active federal/Quebec exploration of a domestic mandate. First
-- stories for Canada, identified via the country-by-country
-- story-count audit. Sourced to the official PSPC/Canada.ca portal.
